      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The main symptom of posttraumatic trouble in the shoulder-joint is the painful immobility. We had to differentiate between genuine shoulder pain originating in shoulder alternation and shoulder pain in consequence of other diseases. Significant causes of posttraumatic shoulder pain are the impingement syndrome with tendon alteration or lesion or, due to fractures, the instable shoulder joint as well as shoulder rigidity. An exact diagnosis and, in consequence an exact treatment can only be accomplished basing on accurate history and specific clinical examination."},
